.TH IX 1 "November 2026" "ix"
.SH NAME
ix \- a small Linux system with a source tree
.SH DESCRIPTION
Root, user, and yhwh have UIDs 0, 1, and 2. Each home has a Makefile.
.B make enterprise
clones the ports under src.
.B make -C /
lists the installed system's entry points.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
make -C / install PORT=thedynamiclinker/gen2
gen2
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gen (1),
.BR yhwh (1)
